# Build products.  The RECORDED outputs ship: vecdump.out, run1.txt,
# run2.txt, vecdump_dis.txt and vecmaps_dis.txt, so that every claim in
# the course is checkable on a machine that never ran the benchmark --
# which is the whole reason the harness takes a path argument and
# defaults to vecdump.out.  The BINARIES do not ship, because a committed
# executable is a file nobody can review and one that is wrong on the
# next gcc.
vecdump
vecdump.bin
vecmaps.bin
*.o
__pycache__/
